            "text": "Phishing susceptibility is influenced by a combination of cognitive, behavioral, and contextual factors, including perceived cyber-risk, self-efficacy in detecting phishing emails, routine internet activities, and device usage. Contradictions with prior research—such as the lack of a significant link between prior victimization and susceptibility—highlight the need for nuanced understanding of fraud indicators and behavioral patterns.",
